        "body": "Please be guided on the proper handling of misrouted calls:\nDO NOT transfer the call\n* If the concern is not under our scope, do not transfer the call to another line.\nProvide the correct hotline\n* Politely inform the customer that they have reached the wrong department.\n* Clearly provide the correct hotline number they should contact for proper assistance.\nIf the customer calls back\n• In case the customer reconnects to you, you may:\n* Use your second name, or\n* Slightly adjust your voice to avoid repeat recognition and ensure smooth handling.\nReminder:\n* Always maintain professionalism and provide clear guidance to the customer.\n* Ensure the customer is properly redirected to the correct support channel.\nCascaded by: Princess"
